  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 54 × 8 – 48 ÷ 12 + 27 = 24.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) – and +\n\nGiven: 54 × 8 – 48 ÷ 12 + 27 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 54 × 8 + __**48 ÷ 12**__ - 27 = 24\n\n⇒ __**54 × 8**__ + 4 - 27 = 24\n\n⇒ __432____** +**____** 4**__ - 27 = 24\n\n⇒ __436____ - 27__ = 24\n\n⇒ 409 ≠ 24\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) **÷ and –**\n\nGiven: 54 × 8 – 48 ÷ 12 + 27 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**54 × 8 ÷ 48**__ - 12 + 27 = 24\n\n⇒ __**9**__ - 12 __**+ 27**__ = 24\n\n⇒ __36 - 12__ = 24\n\n⇒ 24 = 24\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\nGiven: 54 × 8 – 48 ÷ 12 + 27 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 54 + 8 – __**48 ÷ 12**__ × 27 = 24\n\n⇒ 54 + 8 – __**4 × 27**__ = 24\n\n⇒ __**54 + 8**__ – 108 = 24\n\n⇒ __62** – 108**__ = 24\n\n⇒ -46 ≠ 24\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 54 × 8 – 48 ÷ 12 + 27 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 54 × 8 – 48 + __**12 ÷ 27**__ = 24\n\n⇒ **__54 × 8__** – 48 + 0.44 = 24\n\n⇒ __**432**__ – 48 __**+ 0.44**__ = 24\n\n⇒ __432.44 - 48__ = 24\n\n⇒ 384.44 ≠ 24\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
